            "review_title": "Review at Cocobay Restaurant Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "Ольга М\n3 contributions\n0\nFind better.\nJul 2026 • Couples\nAttracted a large number of visitors and the presence of a duck on the menu. Bring back menu folders with greasy stains. Prices are average. The beer glasses are dirty around the edge, the duck undercooked showed up, the meat was not well separated from the bones, perhaps such a recipe for cooking. \nFrom the next table, the waiter sweeps the crumbs to the floor, the table is wiped with cloths that look long unwashed. The wash basin area is dirty. I understand that mud is part of this town's waiba, but still tourists eat here. \nI wish this place to clean up and clean up, and the man I meet at the entrance to consider changing his work wardrobe to a more presentable one. \nI don't recommend it yet.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten August 4, 2026",
